                "text": "Healthcare providers in CD5 are bracing for cuts following the passage of Republicans\u2019 budget.\u00a0\n\nI spoke with representatives from Neighborhood Health Center to hear their concerns. The fight for Medicaid is far from over, and I\u2019m proud to be in the fight alongside them.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nhttps://t.co/Vdu11hLL0T",
