                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Did you know? The average person has a plastic spoon worth of microplastics in their brain\u2026\n\nI introduced a bill to require @HHSGov to report to Congress on the impacts of microplastics on our health, because we\u2019ve got to get to the bottom of this.\n\nWATCH \u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/nCFFlFJKSb",
