                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Microplastics have been found in Chinook salmon, pink shrimp, and other fish in our rivers and streams. \n\nWe need to get to the bottom of what this means for our health \u2013 my Microplastics Safety Act does just that.\n\nhttps://t.co/jn69iCqJi3",
