                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In a study of 30 of Oregon\u2019s most iconic waterways, microplastics were found in 100% of the samples!\n\nYet there hasn\u2019t been a single investigation done by the FDA to see what microplastics do to our health \u2013 that needs to change.\n\nMy Microplastics Safety Act will get us the data we need to protect our health.",
