                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Access to Medicaid and SNAP are a lifeline for thousands of Oregonians, but Republicans\u2019 trash budget has left our communities preparing to have these programs ripped away.\n\nAll to line the pockets of billionaires. It\u2019s unacceptable.\n\nhttps://t.co/R5B8EuaLZy",
