                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s not every day I agree with DOGEai, but it thinks my Microsplastics Safety Act is a good idea!\n\nSafe to say it\u2019s past time we figure out how microplastics are impacting our health. https://t.co/VUYzTyumoX",
