                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s also why I introduced the Microplastics Safety Act \u2013 a first of its kind bill to require @HHSgov to study the impacts of microplastics in our food, water, and more.\n\nWe need to find out more about what microplastics do to our health. \n\n\ud83e\uddf5(2/2)",
