                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "That's why I introduced my Microplastics Safety Act \u2013 to require the FDA to conduct research so we can get the information we need to protect our health.\n\nWe can't wait and see what happens \u2013 we need more information, and we need it now. \ud83e\uddf5 2/2",
