                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Undermining the science behind vaccines is irresponsible and puts Oregonians at risk, which is why I'm glad the Western Health Alliance will be sticking with the data.\n\nThe Trump administration is playing games with Americans' health \u2013 it needs to stop.",
